---
// Razorpay-only donate card — no bank/UPI/QR. Sibling to VolunteerBlock.
---

<section class="group relative rounded-3xl bg-white ring-1 ring-brand-ink/10 shadow-card overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col">
  <div class="h-1.5 bg-brand-red shrink-0"></div>

  <div class="p-5 sm:p-8 flex flex-col gap-5 sm:gap-6 flex-1">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div>
      <span class="chip-red">Donate</span>
      <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-[1.5rem] sm:text-3xl leading-[1.1] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Stand with the <span class="accent-red">movement.</span></h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-brand-ink/70 leading-relaxed">
        Tax-deductible under Section 80G. Receipt emailed within seconds. Secure payment via Razorpay.
      </p>
      <a href="/donate" class="btn-primary mt-4 text-sm">Donate now (80G receipt) →</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Trust strip — matches VolunteerBlock's three-row pattern -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-brand-cream p-4 sm:p-5 mt-auto">
      <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-ink/60 font-semibold">Why give through ABF</div>
      <ul class="mt-3 grid gap-2.5 text-sm">
        <li>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-brand-ink/8 p-3">
            <span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="9" y1="13" x2="15" y2="13"/><line x1="9" y1="17" x2="13" y2="17"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-ink/55 font-semibold">Instant 80G receipt</div>
              <div class="text-sm mt-0.5">Emailed automatically with the PDF attached.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-brand-ink/8 p-3">
            <span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-yellow-deep/20 text-brand-ink" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-ink/55 font-semibold">12A &amp; 80G certified</div>
              <div class="text-sm mt-0.5">Section 8 NPO · donations fully tax-deductible.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-brand-ink/8 p-3">
            <span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-ink/10 text-brand-ink" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-ink/55 font-semibold">Secure via Razorpay</div>
              <div class="text-sm mt-0.5">UPI, cards, net-banking, wallets — all in one flow.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
